WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.015
Hi, I'm Sara from A9 Voice.

2
00:00:03.055 --> 00:00:07.199
In a new meeting, people show
up as Speaker 2, Speaker 3.

3
00:00:07.239 --> 00:00:08.961
Let's put names on them.

4
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.672
While you record, open the Live window.

5
00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:17.118
When someone's talking, type their name
in "Who's talking?" and press Enter

6
00:00:17.158 --> 00:00:19.311
and the whole speaker gets that name.

7
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:21.412
Missed someone?

8
00:00:21.452 --> 00:00:23.796
Name them on the note page after the call.

9
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.632
Want it automatic next time?

10
00:00:28.672 --> 00:00:30.662
Turn on Recognize people by voice.

11
00:00:30.702 --> 00:00:33.766
A9 Voice learns how each
person you've named sounds,

12
00:00:33.806 --> 00:00:36.214
and names them for you in later meetings.

13
00:00:36.867 --> 00:00:39.991
A voiceprint is a set of
numbers, not a recording.

14
00:00:40.031 --> 00:00:43.282
It stays on your PC, and
you can delete it any time.

15
00:00:44.733 --> 00:00:45.559
That's it.

16
00:00:45.599 --> 00:00:46.857
Name them once.
